# Body

- Event payloads: TypeScript types in fenced blocks, not prose field tables.
- Environments: live vs non-live. Do not cite concrete overlays (`qa9.yaml`, `prod.yaml`).
- Cite real paths: migrations, `helm_env_configs` gotmpl, exported interfaces. Do not invent APIs.
- Standalone handoff pages embed related material. No outbound wiki or ADR links on those pages.

